to\">🛠️ Troubleshooting</h2></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Issue</th>\n<th>Solution</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Trainer won't start</td>\n<td>Run as Administrator, temporarily disable antivirus</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Features not working</td>\n<td>Restart the trainer and the software, make sure you're in the main interface</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GUI not appearing</td>\n<td>Press the activation key (INSERT/F1) or restart the trainer</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">📜 License</h2></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">MIT – see <a href=\"https://github.com/zhaixiansen1023-cpu/QR_Code_Scanner/blob/main/LICENSE\">LICENSE</a> file.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">🔍 Tags</h2></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>qr-scanner, barcode-scanner, decode, webcam, screenshot, history, tool, free, 2026, windows</code></p>\n</article></div>",
